    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/ba204fae5a51cefd56ffc26153e1fc82.poster.avif?t=1736769378\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/ba204fae5a51cefd56ffc26153e1fc82.webm?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/ba204fae5a51cefd56ffc26153e1fc82.mp4?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/99bba9219dc04298baf904137b346571.poster.avif?t=1736769378\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/99bba9219dc04298baf904137b346571.webm?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/99bba9219dc04298baf904137b346571.mp4?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are a time traveling pigeon sent to stop a twisted goose from destroying reality. Along the way, enjoy the freedom of pigeon life as you soar through busy environments, befriend colorful characters, and blanket every visible surface in guano goodness. But you\u2019re no ordinary sky rat. Eat stuff to alter your biology and unlock a strange mix of superpowers and special abilities.<br><br>Will you own your reputation as nature\u2019s most notorious bird? It\u2019s all up to you in this silly physics sandbox adventure from HakJak Studios!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Physics-based destruction engine.</strong> Rain down Armageddon or just smash a few windows. If you can see it, it\u2019s fair game.<br></li><li><strong>DNA-powered ability system.</strong> Normal bird chromosomes, mutated for your entertainment.<br></li><li><strong>Nonlinear comedic narrative.</strong> With a huge-brained pigeon scientist to guide you, uncover an absurd sci-fi story packed with ridiculous quests. <br></li><li><strong>Hybrid handcrafted and procedural worlds.</strong> Explore vibrant settings with themes like pro wrestling, desert demolition, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Outlandish talking animals AND people.</strong> Discover a new chatty weirdo around every corner.<br></li><li><strong>Cutting edge poop tech.</strong> Truly state of the art. Don\u2019t hold back.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/17a033fecb9a4827e5cb542fdf4280c7.poster.avif?t=1736769378\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/17a033fecb9a4827e5cb542fdf4280c7.webm?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/17a033fecb9a4827e5cb542fdf4280c7.mp4?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Become a part of our growing flock! Access game news, updates, and exclusive media on the Pigeon Simulator Discord server.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/7f03c42595e86763ad225e362a2d61da.poster.avif?t=1736769378\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/7f03c42595e86763ad225e362a2d61da.webm?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496260/extras/7f03c42595e86763ad225e362a2d61da.mp4?t=1736769378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Get your claws on the game before